   "q": "<p>Look at the programme of the <b>Teen Fest</b>.</p>\n<table><tr><th colspan=\"3\">TEEN FEST – SATURDAY PROGRAMME</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>10.00 – 11.30</b></td><td>Street Dance Show</td><td>Stage A</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>12.00 – 13.00</b></td><td>Poetry Reading</td><td>Hall B</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>14.00 – 15.30</b></td><td>Heavy Metal Concert</td><td>Stage A</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>15.30 – 16.30</b></td><td>Comic Book Workshop</td><td>Hall B</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>18.00 – 20.00</b></td><td>Jazz Night</td><td>Stage A</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"box\"><i>Selin will arrive at the festival at noon, and she must leave before 5 p.m. She can’t stand loud music, and she isn’t keen on poems. She is fond of sketching cartoon characters.</i></div>\n<p>Which activity will Selin probably attend?</p>",
   "c": [
    "Street Dance Show",
    "Heavy Metal Concert",
    "Comic Book Workshop",
    "Jazz Night"
   ],
   "a": "C",
   "s": "<ul>\n<li>Street Dance Show 10.00’da → Selin öğlen (12.00) geliyor ✗</li>\n<li>Heavy Metal Concert → yüksek sesli müziğe katlanamıyor (<i>can’t stand loud music</i>) ✗</li>\n<li>Comic Book Workshop 15.30–16.30 → saat 5’ten önce bitiyor ve karikatür çizmeyi seviyor ✓</li>\n<li>Jazz Night 18.00’de → saat 5’ten önce ayrılmalı ✗</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Poetry Reading seçeneklerde yok ama şiirden de hoşlanmıyor.</p><p>Cevap <b>C</b>.</p>"
