   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Read the rules of the Summer Science Camp.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><b>CAMP RULES</b><br>• You must be at breakfast by 8 a.m.<br>• You mustn’t use your mobile phone during the workshops.<br>• You don’t have to wear the camp T-shirt on Sundays.<br>• You have to be in your room by 10 p.m.</div>\n<p>Four campers are talking about their day. Which camper broke a camp rule?</p>",
