   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>40 students in class 8/C answered the question <b>“Which free-time activity do you enjoy most?”</b> The results are in the chart below.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 300\" width=\"520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"520\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" text-anchor=\"end\">\n<text x=\"52\" y=\"254\">0</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"214\">4</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"174\">8</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"134\">12</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"94\">16</text></g>\n<g stroke=\"#ddd\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"210\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"130\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"90\"/></g>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"130\" width=\"56\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#4e79a7\"/>\n<rect x=\"166\" y=\"190\" width=\"56\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#f28e2b\"/>\n<rect x=\"252\" y=\"150\" width=\"56\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#59a14f\"/>\n<rect x=\"338\" y=\"210\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#e15759\"/>\n<rect x=\"424\" y=\"170\" width=\"56\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#b07aa1\"/>\n<g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<text x=\"108\" y=\"270\">Gaming</text><text x=\"194\" y=\"270\">Dancing</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"270\">Sports</text><text x=\"366\" y=\"270\">Reading</text><text x=\"452\" y=\"270\">Drawing</text></g>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\">Number of students</text>\n</svg></div>\n<p>According to the chart, which of the following is TRUE?</p>",
