   "q": "<p>Read Zehra’s blog post.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><b>ZEHRA’S CORNER</b><br>Hi, I’m Zehra from İzmir and I’m 14. I’m really into baking. Every Saturday morning, I bake cookies with my grandma. My brother Onur is crazy about video games, but I find them boring. I’d rather spend time outdoors. On Sundays, I go cycling along the coast with my best friend Nisa, and we usually stop at a café for hot chocolate. Nisa isn’t keen on baking, but she loves eating my cookies!</div>\n<p>Which of the following is TRUE according to the blog post?</p>",
