   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Damla and her friend İpek want to join the same music course. Read what they say and look at the courses below.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Damla:</b> I’m only free on Tuesdays and Thursdays after 4 p.m.</div>\n<div><b>İpek:</b> I’m not keen on string instruments. I’d rather play an instrument with keys or drums. And we can’t pay more than 1800 TL a month.</div></div>\n<table><tr><th>Course</th><th>Days</th><th>Time</th><th>Monthly price</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Guitar</td><td>Tuesday – Thursday</td><td>5 – 6 p.m.</td><td>1500 TL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Drums</td><td>Monday – Wednesday</td><td>5 – 6 p.m.</td><td>1600 TL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Piano</td><td>Tuesday – Thursday</td><td>4.30 – 5.30 p.m.</td><td>1750 TL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Keyboard</td><td>Tuesday – Thursday</td><td>3 – 4 p.m.</td><td>1400 TL</td></tr></table>\n<p>Which course will they most probably choose?</p>",
