   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Akın is 14 years old and he wants to go to a summer camp. Read what he says and look at the camps below.</p>\n<div class=\"box\">“I’m interested in science and technology. I’ll be on holiday with my family in July, so I’m only free in August. My parents can pay at most 4000 TL.”</div>\n<table><tr><th>Camp</th><th>Dates</th><th>Ages</th><th>Price</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Robotics Camp</td><td>10 – 16 July</td><td>12 – 15</td><td>3500 TL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Coding Camp</td><td>5 – 11 August</td><td>16 – 18</td><td>3800 TL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Space Camp</td><td>12 – 18 August</td><td>12 – 15</td><td>4500 TL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Science Camp</td><td>20 – 26 August</td><td>12 – 16</td><td>3900 TL</td></tr></table>\n<p>Which camp is the most suitable for Akın?</p>",
