   "q": "<p>Three friends are talking about their weekend plans.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Toprak:</b> I’m going to the aquarium with my cousin on Saturday. I adore sea creatures!</div>\n<div><b>Elçin:</b> I’d rather sleep late on Saturdays, so I’ll go to the aquarium on Sunday afternoon.</div>\n<div><b>Barış:</b> I don’t fancy the aquarium. I’ll practise the drums all weekend.</div></div>\n<p>Which of the following is TRUE?</p>",
